@baseUrl = http://localhost:4545/api/v1
@seriesId = abs:replace-with-audiobookshelf-series-id
@seriesAsin = replace-with-audible-series-asin

### Preview every unresolved Audiobookshelf/imported series
GET {{baseUrl}}/series/resolution/preview?region=us

### Preview one imported series by its stable Listenarr series ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/series/resolution/preview?seriesId={{seriesId}}&region=us

### Merge memberships after reviewing and confirming a preview candidate
POST {{baseUrl}}/series/resolution/merge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seriesId": "{{seriesId}}",
  "candidateAsin": "{{seriesAsin}}",
  "region": "us"
}

### Refresh a selected Audible series catalog by its ASIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/series/resolution/catalog/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asin": "{{seriesAsin}}",
  "name": "Dungeon Crawler Carl",
  "region": "us"
}
